post.description:
Create a new government agency/institution.

**Access Control:** System admins only

**Request Body**:
```json
{
    "name": "MININFRA",
    "realmRoles": ["employee"],
    "clientRoles": {
        "kubaka-web": ["view-agency", "manage-projects"],
        "rdb-portal": ["view-permits"]
    },
    "attributes": {
        "type": ["ministry"],
        "code": ["MININFRA"]
    }
}
```

**Use Case**: Onboarding a new government institution to SSO
